<title>RUSSIA: City of Moscow sets Eurobond roadshow May 11-25.</title>
<headline>City of Moscow sets Eurobond roadshow May 11-25.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The City of Moscow, which plans to issue $400-$500 million in a three to five year Eurobond soon, will hold the roadshow for the issue between May 11 and 25, a spokesman for the Moscow government said on Friday.</p>
<p>The presentations will take place in Europe and Asia and finish in the U.S., Mikhail Chernyshov told Reuters.</p>
<p>--Julie Tolkacheva, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
